WEBVTT

00:07.400 --> 00:09.400
[eerie music playing]

00:11.760 --> 00:13.920
[rustling]

00:17.840 --> 00:19.840
[tense music playing]

00:25.280 --> 00:27.720
[Nanno] The right to punish
the wrongdoers…

00:29.800 --> 00:31.480
[indistinct sobbing]

00:33.560 --> 00:35.960
[Nanno] …is given
to those who are in charge.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.640
[sobbing continues]

00:41.040 --> 00:43.160
[Nanno] But what is going to happen…

00:45.160 --> 00:47.280
if the ones in charge…

00:51.240 --> 00:53.080
get persecuted themselves.

00:54.320 --> 00:58.200
-[knife stabbing]
-[sobbing continues]

01:05.760 --> 01:06.920
[gasps]

01:10.920 --> 01:12.920
[theme music playing]

02:38.120 --> 02:42.280
SCHOOL BUILDING

02:42.360 --> 02:44.360
[foreboding music playing]

02:52.400 --> 02:54.640
CONGRATULATIONS TO JUNKO JIRAIYAWAT

02:54.720 --> 02:56.880
THE NATIONAL BIOLOGY OLYMPIAD
GOLD MEDALIST

03:16.400 --> 03:18.400
[suspenseful music playing]

03:24.040 --> 03:26.440
Are you starting to doubt
what you're doing here?

03:31.880 --> 03:36.760
[student] Junko, come decorate with us.
You can help us cut some paper.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.600
-Yeah.
-[Junko] Mmm-hmm.

04:16.600 --> 04:19.680
Hi, I'm Nanno. I'm a new student here.

04:20.360 --> 04:21.560
Are you Junko?

04:23.200 --> 04:25.680
Weren't you the one who won
the Biology award?

04:28.120 --> 04:29.120
Mmm-hmm.

04:29.200 --> 04:30.760
[claps]

04:30.840 --> 04:31.960
Good job.

04:37.320 --> 04:38.360
It's nothing.

04:41.280 --> 04:43.680
I can't go play outside
with the other kids.

04:44.680 --> 04:47.920
So, I read instead. It's not fun.

04:51.000 --> 04:54.480
Why are you in that chair?
Is something wrong with your legs?

04:56.800 --> 04:58.480
I've always had this condition.

05:01.440 --> 05:04.120
You've always had this condition.

05:04.720 --> 05:05.960
What's wrong with you?

05:09.040 --> 05:11.040
[dramatic music playing]

05:19.280 --> 05:20.280
Ahh!

05:21.320 --> 05:22.720
[student] Junko, you okay?

05:23.400 --> 05:25.600
Take her to the nurse's office now.

05:30.920 --> 05:33.160
[student] Junko has hemophilia.

05:33.640 --> 05:36.120
When she gets a wound,
it causes lots of bleeding.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.640
It's dangerous.

05:39.440 --> 05:42.000
And she needs to be careful.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.960
It can be life threatening.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.720
I feel bad for her.

05:46.240 --> 05:49.840
This disorder has no cure
or treatment at all.

05:49.920 --> 05:52.880
[student] Now that you know,
you can donate to her.

05:52.960 --> 05:53.880
There's info here.

05:53.960 --> 05:56.520
JUNKO THE POOR GENIUS - DONATE TO KOMKRIT
TO HELP PAY FOR TREATMENT

05:57.280 --> 05:59.400
[man 1 on phone] Here's 200 baht
to help you, Junko.

05:59.480 --> 06:01.920
[man 2] Here's 50 baht, Junko. Get better.

06:02.000 --> 06:05.160
[woman] Do you think 50 baht
can really help her?

06:05.240 --> 06:06.920
[man 2] I give her 50 baht every day.

06:07.000 --> 06:10.320
Stop insulting me. I don't know you.

06:10.400 --> 06:14.160
A TRANSFER SLIP OF 5,000 BAHT

06:14.240 --> 06:18.640
A 5,000 BAHT TRANSFER
MADE TO TEACHER WAAN

06:41.760 --> 06:43.760
[mysterious music playing]

06:50.120 --> 06:53.680
[Waan] You have to be extra careful
when you use scissors, remember?

06:58.000 --> 07:01.400
Because it's more dangerous
if you get cut, okay?

07:05.800 --> 07:08.800
-[clock ticking]
-[threatening music playing]

07:25.320 --> 07:28.600
Hello, are you the new girl
in Junko's class?

07:30.520 --> 07:31.400
Yeah.

07:32.960 --> 07:33.960
I'm Nanno.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.840
[Waan] What are you doing here?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.840
I wanted to check on Junko.

07:39.320 --> 07:43.240
I was there when she cut herself
and it was…

07:44.560 --> 07:45.800
[Waan] Don't be afraid, dear.

07:46.600 --> 07:48.320
Junko's always been very fragile.

07:48.840 --> 07:50.440
That's why she gets injections everyday.

07:54.040 --> 07:56.040
[ominous music playing]

08:25.280 --> 08:26.720
I love you so much,

08:28.000 --> 08:29.560
and I'm not going to lose you.

08:31.360 --> 08:33.520
Has Junko always been in that chair?

08:34.320 --> 08:36.960
-Yes, since she was little.
-How unfortunate.

08:37.840 --> 08:38.800
Yeah.

08:38.880 --> 08:42.480
Junko is so strong, but it's hard--

08:42.560 --> 08:44.040
No, I'm talking about your life.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.200
[sighs]

08:50.280 --> 08:53.080
It must be exhausting for you

08:53.160 --> 08:54.920
to look after her forever.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.640
I've heard people say

08:57.720 --> 09:02.520
that they wanna have kids so the children
will look after them when they get old.

09:03.080 --> 09:06.160
But, for you, that day will never come.

09:06.840 --> 09:09.280
You will have to watch Junko
your whole life,

09:09.840 --> 09:12.320
and she won't be able to do that for you.

09:15.880 --> 09:20.200
But that isn't how I see it.
I want to help my child.

09:20.280 --> 09:22.240
And I would like her to be healthy.

09:23.000 --> 09:24.600
[school bell dings]

09:24.680 --> 09:25.960
Oh…

09:26.040 --> 09:28.120
It's time for class. Come on.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.680
[dinging continues]

09:43.360 --> 09:44.600
Hmm.

09:48.400 --> 09:50.400
[electronic music playing]

09:53.880 --> 09:55.200
[inhales]

10:01.840 --> 10:03.040
Here, eat something.

10:05.800 --> 10:07.800
[soft piano music playing]

10:22.200 --> 10:24.320
[doorbell rings]

10:36.160 --> 10:37.200
[door opens]

10:40.240 --> 10:41.560
[man grunting]

10:42.560 --> 10:44.880
-You can put it in the corner.
-Yes, ma'am.

10:45.760 --> 10:46.920
Put it over there.

10:48.400 --> 10:49.720
-[Waan] Thank you.
-[man] Sure.

10:57.320 --> 10:58.160
[door closes]

11:02.640 --> 11:03.640
[Waan] Are you full?

11:04.640 --> 11:05.520
Yeah.

11:58.000 --> 11:59.840
[winding]

11:59.920 --> 12:02.200
[rustling]

12:10.640 --> 12:13.240
[music box playing
"Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star"]

12:24.360 --> 12:25.640
[exhales sharply]

12:30.760 --> 12:33.440
[music box continues]

12:36.240 --> 12:38.240
[eerie music playing]

13:00.920 --> 13:02.280
[door opens and closes]

13:13.440 --> 13:15.440
[foreboding music playing]

13:19.680 --> 13:20.800
[indistinct clatter]

13:26.600 --> 13:27.440
Who's there?

13:36.800 --> 13:38.040
Is someone there?

13:43.960 --> 13:45.960
[ominous music playing]

14:07.440 --> 14:08.280
Hi.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.400
Hi.

14:10.920 --> 14:13.520
Hmm. Feeling okay? Why are you in here?

14:13.600 --> 14:15.760
[laughs] I feel just fine.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.880
Then why aren't you in class?

14:21.040 --> 14:22.960
You know I'm the new kid in school, right?

14:23.040 --> 14:23.880
Mmm.

14:24.640 --> 14:28.760
I transferred here because I wanted
to meet a teacher who used to work here.

14:29.720 --> 14:32.160
But she seems to have left.

14:32.240 --> 14:35.280
I don't suppose you know
what happened to her?

14:37.680 --> 14:38.760
[chuckles]

14:38.840 --> 14:40.480
Oh, Supatra, you mean her?

14:41.200 --> 14:42.840
She left school last semester.

14:42.920 --> 14:44.280
-[Nanno] Really?
-Yeah.

14:45.200 --> 14:47.720
-Well, then where did she go?
-[Waan chuckles]

14:47.800 --> 14:51.320
I'm not too sure.
She didn't tell me where she went.

14:51.400 --> 14:52.880
We really weren't that close.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.720
You weren't close,

14:56.560 --> 14:59.280
but didn't you work together
in this office?

14:59.840 --> 15:03.720
Ah, yeah. I texted her several times,
but she didn't text back.

15:04.600 --> 15:06.480
It took me by surprise when she left.

15:06.560 --> 15:08.960
She left without even saying goodbye.

15:09.640 --> 15:12.680
Hmm.
[clicks tongue] She didn't say goodbye.

15:13.320 --> 15:17.080
Come to think of it,
I haven't met many teachers here.

15:17.760 --> 15:19.360
[Nanno] For example…

15:21.200 --> 15:22.960
Ms. Iriyachai.

15:23.680 --> 15:25.920
Doesn't she teach biology?

15:26.880 --> 15:31.240
What about Komkrit, Teethawat, Nalinna,

15:31.320 --> 15:32.400
and Tawanwad?

15:35.080 --> 15:37.360
-Have they all left as well?
-[Waan chuckles]

15:37.920 --> 15:40.400
Mmm. There's nothing strange about that.

15:40.880 --> 15:45.320
Teachers at this school come and go
all the time. It's completely normal.

15:45.400 --> 15:48.720
When they find somewhere
better to go, then…

15:48.800 --> 15:50.240
[chuckles] …they choose to leave.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.560
By "better,"

15:52.120 --> 15:58.000
do you mean somewhere
that's stuffy and salty?

15:58.760 --> 16:01.240
[tense music playing]

16:05.440 --> 16:08.120
I mean like a beautiful school
that's by the beach.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.480
[chuckles]

16:11.560 --> 16:12.960
Yes, I suppose so.

16:14.600 --> 16:15.880
[inhales deeply]

16:15.960 --> 16:18.640
Everyone wants to move somewhere better.

16:18.720 --> 16:20.640
Don't you want to move somewhere else?

16:21.480 --> 16:22.800
[chuckles]

16:22.880 --> 16:24.000
I can't go anywhere.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.920
You have to watch Junko.

16:26.000 --> 16:27.160
Mmm.

16:29.000 --> 16:30.680
Okay, time to go to class.

16:30.760 --> 16:33.720
Actually, I came here…

16:34.640 --> 16:36.120
to return this to you.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.080
You left it behind.

16:39.800 --> 16:44.920
At first I thought
it was just Junko's desmopressin…

16:47.480 --> 16:50.040
for treating her hemophilia.

16:50.760 --> 16:52.360
Turns out it's not.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.640
[chuckles]

17:01.720 --> 17:04.280
The teachers, this school…

17:05.560 --> 17:07.160
it's all really so strange.

17:08.400 --> 17:10.360
[suspenseful music playing]

17:34.720 --> 17:37.440
[student] Ms. Waan,
Junko slipped in the bathroom!

17:37.520 --> 17:39.200
[Waan gasps] Junko!

17:43.240 --> 17:44.680
[grunts]

17:48.920 --> 17:49.960
[grunts]

17:57.920 --> 17:59.360
[exhales]

18:03.880 --> 18:05.280
[sighs]

18:10.360 --> 18:15.600
[humming "Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star"]

18:31.880 --> 18:33.280
[phone chimes]

18:38.040 --> 18:39.120
[chimes]

18:43.160 --> 18:44.040
[Waan gasps]

18:45.680 --> 18:46.800
[chimes]

18:46.880 --> 18:49.960
[Nanno on phone] What have you been
injecting into Junko, huh?

18:50.440 --> 18:53.080
-[ominous music playing]
-[phone chimes]

18:55.080 --> 18:57.080
[tense music playing]

19:17.040 --> 19:20.120
[Nanno] And you killed
anyone who knew about it.

19:23.120 --> 19:26.080
Should I post about it all online?

19:27.800 --> 19:29.800
[ominous music playing]

19:39.240 --> 19:41.760
[Yuri] Are you happy with your choices?

19:45.800 --> 19:50.280
You're so disappointing.
If I were you, I would just kill her.

19:52.480 --> 19:55.240
Isn't it Waan, the person you saw
in your dream?

19:57.360 --> 19:59.800
We're like two peas in a pod, Nanno.

19:59.880 --> 20:02.720
You know that. Your blood is in my veins.

20:04.000 --> 20:07.920
In a way, we're kind of like
mother and daughter, yeah?

20:08.000 --> 20:09.120
[laughs]

20:10.080 --> 20:11.240
I don't think so.

20:14.640 --> 20:18.880
You want to kill people.
Is that all you think about?

20:20.240 --> 20:21.480
[laughs]

20:21.560 --> 20:24.480
And that dream
is never going to come true.

20:26.280 --> 20:29.400
You might regret believing that it won't.

20:30.840 --> 20:31.920
[phone chimes]

20:34.040 --> 20:36.320
TEACHER WAAN
Let's talk

20:41.640 --> 20:44.320
[suspenseful music playing]

21:09.360 --> 21:11.280
No one is going to believe you.

21:12.200 --> 21:14.840
All the evidence I need is inside Junko.

21:14.920 --> 21:17.480
And you keep the bodies in your home.

21:18.400 --> 21:22.760
Is it easy to make money
off of people's sympathy?

21:24.680 --> 21:27.680
I'm warning you, you don't know anything.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.560
What, about how…

21:30.200 --> 21:34.040
you can't live on a teacher's salary

21:34.520 --> 21:38.440
so you make your daughter sick for money?

21:39.400 --> 21:40.720
Is that what you mean?

21:43.320 --> 21:46.640
Maybe, the time has come

21:47.320 --> 21:50.720
for you to be punished
for what you've done.

21:50.800 --> 21:52.000
What are you going to do?

21:54.040 --> 21:55.200
[grunts]

21:56.160 --> 21:57.040
[grunts]

21:58.080 --> 21:59.720
[grunting]

22:02.800 --> 22:04.480
[Waan groans]

22:10.440 --> 22:12.120
You don't have to worry.

22:13.120 --> 22:15.640
I'm not going to hurt you.

22:16.640 --> 22:19.840
There are so many others
who are willing to do that.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.640
No!

22:21.720 --> 22:23.000
SHARE

22:23.080 --> 22:24.080
You don't understand.

22:24.160 --> 22:27.720
I raise that money for the people's
families who were murdered, okay?

22:27.800 --> 22:28.720
[laughs]

22:29.400 --> 22:31.080
Yeah, by poisoning Junko.

22:31.160 --> 22:34.200
I didn't poison her. I'm protecting her.

22:35.840 --> 22:38.280
[Waan]
I did that to keep everyone else safe.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.600
Junko is a monster.

22:42.360 --> 22:43.840
[Waan] She killed all those people.

22:48.080 --> 22:49.800
She has this disability.

22:51.560 --> 22:55.000
She was frail and they bullied her.

22:55.080 --> 22:57.320
-[Junko screams]
-[students laughing]

22:59.360 --> 23:01.800
[student] Look at her! Get up if you can!

23:01.880 --> 23:03.440
-Look at her.
-[Junko] Please help me.

23:03.520 --> 23:05.080
[teacher] What's going on here?

23:05.160 --> 23:06.920
[whimpers] They're hurting me.

23:07.880 --> 23:09.760
[sobbing]

23:10.760 --> 23:15.160
But we just wanted her, um,
to stand on her own two feet.

23:17.280 --> 23:21.040
Junko, please don't be such a burden
to others.

23:24.480 --> 23:27.400
[Waan] Junko hated everyone at her school.

23:30.840 --> 23:33.440
She asked to stay home
until her legs were healed.

23:36.640 --> 23:41.480
She spent the whole day in her room
surrounded by the thing she loved most.

23:43.120 --> 23:45.040
And that thing was…

23:46.880 --> 23:48.400
anatomy.

23:53.080 --> 23:56.040
At first, I didn't think it was so bad.

23:58.560 --> 24:01.720
Then one day when she could walk again,

24:01.800 --> 24:02.880
I discovered that…

24:02.960 --> 24:05.080
Why did you take me here, Junko?

24:05.160 --> 24:08.000
If it's not cool, then,
I'm just gonna leave.

24:12.440 --> 24:15.040
I have some snacks. [gasps]

24:18.520 --> 24:20.760
Mom, it's so pretty.

24:22.040 --> 24:24.040
[dark orchestral music playing]

24:24.120 --> 24:27.600
[sobbing]

24:29.160 --> 24:31.200
[Waan grunting]

24:36.760 --> 24:38.440
[straining]

24:48.800 --> 24:51.200
I tried to make everything go away.

24:56.680 --> 24:59.440
[sobbing]

25:04.000 --> 25:05.720
[Waan] I tried to protect her,

25:10.120 --> 25:11.840
and protect everyone else.

25:19.880 --> 25:21.560
That's why I gave her injections,

25:21.640 --> 25:24.040
so she would stop killing people.

25:24.120 --> 25:28.040
[orchestral music climaxing]

25:30.640 --> 25:31.640
I…

25:32.400 --> 25:34.840
I really tried to do my best
as her mother, okay?

25:37.760 --> 25:39.160
Without me…

25:39.760 --> 25:41.640
Junko could kill even more people.

25:43.160 --> 25:44.920
Your responsibility…

25:45.920 --> 25:47.520
as her mother…

25:48.400 --> 25:50.120
is to cover Junko's crimes?

25:50.200 --> 25:52.280
There isn't any justification.

25:54.960 --> 25:57.080
Junko is a real monster.

26:01.760 --> 26:05.480
[Yuri] Did you hear all that, Junko?
Your mother poisoned you.

26:08.600 --> 26:09.760
Junko.

26:11.920 --> 26:15.160
I told you that your mother
can't be trusted.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.320
And who are you?

26:17.600 --> 26:19.000
I'm a friend of Junko's.

26:19.080 --> 26:21.800
-A friend?
-I'm a close friend of hers.

26:21.880 --> 26:23.920
I'm close enough to know

26:24.000 --> 26:25.480
what you've been doing to her.

26:25.560 --> 26:26.760
You know what?

26:31.240 --> 26:33.360
[Yuri] We've both been victimized.

26:33.920 --> 26:36.920
What right do they have to judge us?

26:39.560 --> 26:41.600
Things are going to change
from here on out.

26:41.680 --> 26:43.680
[ominous music playing]

26:59.440 --> 27:03.760
I'm sorry, but I had to.
I didn't want you to kill any more people.

27:06.240 --> 27:08.200
Those people all deserve what they got.

27:11.760 --> 27:13.760
They would just bully me all the time.

27:14.240 --> 27:15.640
[laughing]

27:15.720 --> 27:17.360
Get your wheelchair, go!

27:18.520 --> 27:21.000
Look, intestines.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.840
The useless teacher…

27:23.880 --> 27:26.160
who said I was a burden to the school.

27:27.560 --> 27:28.880
I wanted revenge.

27:31.280 --> 27:33.440
Yuri said I'm entitled to that,
and I agree.

27:37.720 --> 27:39.600
How could you hurt me this way?

27:39.680 --> 27:41.440
I never meant to hurt you, Junko.

27:42.240 --> 27:44.000
I only did it to protect you.

27:44.080 --> 27:45.160
Protect me?

27:45.960 --> 27:48.440
We've been doing just fine this whole time

27:48.520 --> 27:51.320
until these people showed up
and disrupted our lives.

27:51.400 --> 27:53.920
My life was so much better
when I was able to kill.

27:58.560 --> 28:00.320
And you took that away from me.

28:16.600 --> 28:20.560
I actually switched the medication

28:20.640 --> 28:22.160
and replaced it with vitamins.

28:23.560 --> 28:27.520
So, the weak and vulnerable Junko
that you saw was…

28:28.160 --> 28:29.480
It was just an act.

28:30.040 --> 28:31.520
[chuckles]

28:45.240 --> 28:46.120
Junko.

28:53.160 --> 28:55.160
[dramatic music playing]

29:08.080 --> 29:09.200
[Waan] Junko…

29:09.920 --> 29:10.920
[yelps]

29:12.600 --> 29:13.640
[gasps]

29:21.800 --> 29:22.800
Ahh!

29:28.880 --> 29:29.920
Junko!

29:30.760 --> 29:32.000
I'm your mother.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.520
But I don't care!

29:34.600 --> 29:35.680
[screaming]

29:35.760 --> 29:37.920
What do you think we should do?

29:38.000 --> 29:40.560
Should we let the daughter
kill her own mother…

29:40.640 --> 29:42.200
or let her live?

29:46.720 --> 29:48.800
[both grunting and screaming]

29:56.440 --> 30:01.040
If you knew Junko was a killer,
why would you help her then?

30:01.120 --> 30:04.400
Don't you want to punish people
like I taught you to do?

30:04.920 --> 30:06.640
We just use different methods.

30:09.160 --> 30:11.800
[panting]

30:16.280 --> 30:17.600
[Waan] Junko!

30:18.360 --> 30:20.880
Please don't make me do this to you.

30:21.360 --> 30:24.360
Junko is a victim just like I am.

30:24.440 --> 30:26.920
All we wanted was to get revenge.

30:27.840 --> 30:28.800
[laughs softly]

30:29.600 --> 30:31.400
People like you and Junko…

30:31.960 --> 30:34.840
can hardly call yourselves victims.

30:36.920 --> 30:39.560
It's probably hard to judge
who's at fault here.

30:40.600 --> 30:43.640
Is it Waan who crippled her own daughter
to stop her,

30:44.200 --> 30:47.960
or is it Junko who got her revenge
for being bullied?

30:48.640 --> 30:50.240
Can you really judge

30:50.320 --> 30:51.800
who's the worst?

30:53.640 --> 30:56.040
[Waan] You should
be thankful I let you live!

30:56.120 --> 30:57.760
I protected you!

30:58.720 --> 31:01.680
[sobbing] You didn't have to suffer ever!

31:01.760 --> 31:03.640
I'd go to jail for what you did.

31:04.760 --> 31:06.600
You kill people, Junko.

31:06.680 --> 31:08.760
Instead of showing me gratitude,

31:09.320 --> 31:10.200
you try to kill me.

31:10.280 --> 31:12.360
[both scream]

31:14.240 --> 31:15.800
[both panting]

31:17.720 --> 31:19.400
[both scream]

31:22.360 --> 31:25.080
[panting]

31:34.200 --> 31:35.960
[groaning]

31:39.360 --> 31:41.120
[sobbing] Junko.

31:42.080 --> 31:46.160
Please stop. I'm sorry.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.680
I love you, Junko, so much.

31:58.920 --> 32:01.080
[sobbing] Junko.

32:07.360 --> 32:09.920
[both crying]

32:19.960 --> 32:21.040
Mom.

32:24.280 --> 32:26.280
[sobbing] Junko.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.600
[gasps]

32:35.440 --> 32:37.640
Don't you like to call me a monster?

32:39.360 --> 32:40.400
[Junko] Huh?

32:43.600 --> 32:45.920
Prove to me that you are my mother.

32:46.560 --> 32:49.440
A mother about to be killed
by her own daughter.

32:55.200 --> 33:01.120
[straining] My… I can't let you live
the rest of your life if I'm not there.

33:01.200 --> 33:04.360
[both crying]

33:04.440 --> 33:06.240
I'm sorry.

33:06.320 --> 33:08.280
[sobbing]

33:18.160 --> 33:23.440
[girl humming
"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star"]

33:26.400 --> 33:27.680
[sobbing]

33:35.360 --> 33:40.160
[Waan humming
"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star"]

33:54.200 --> 33:56.200
[humming continues]

34:11.960 --> 34:14.720
-[crying]
-[humming continues]

34:43.800 --> 34:47.080
So, have you decided who is guilty here?

35:00.520 --> 35:02.440
-[gasps]
-[stabs]

35:11.360 --> 35:13.680
[ominous music playing]

35:25.160 --> 35:27.360
[laughing maniacally]

35:40.880 --> 35:42.880
[somber music playing]

36:06.720 --> 36:07.960
[stabbing]

36:08.040 --> 36:10.840
-[orchestral piano music playing]
-[inaudible]

36:10.920 --> 36:12.920
[orchestral music continues]

36:43.400 --> 36:45.400
[panting, grunting]

36:45.480 --> 36:47.280
You shouldn't have come here.

36:47.360 --> 36:49.240
This was all supposed to be a secret.

36:49.320 --> 36:51.280
-[Waan grunting]
-[slushing]

36:51.360 --> 36:52.760
[Waan] You hear me?

36:55.680 --> 36:59.480
[Yuri]
The wickedness of humans never ends.

37:02.200 --> 37:06.800
Even love can be used
to do selfish things.

37:07.800 --> 37:08.640
[stabbing]

37:09.280 --> 37:11.760
[sobbing] I'm so sorry.

37:12.320 --> 37:14.880
[Yuri] That's how it goes.

37:17.520 --> 37:20.520
-[orchestral music continues]
-[stabbing continues]

37:34.640 --> 37:36.640
-[music fading]
-[sobbing]

37:41.880 --> 37:44.720
[screaming]

37:53.520 --> 37:55.600
[sobbing]

38:22.200 --> 38:24.200
-[choking]
-[knife slicing]

38:27.280 --> 38:29.280
[somber music playing]

38:33.000 --> 38:35.000
[ethereal music playing]

39:11.160 --> 39:12.680
Your time's over, Nanno.

39:17.800 --> 39:19.000
[laughs]

39:32.200 --> 39:36.400
I will give people the power
to destroy one another.

39:40.720 --> 39:41.960
[grunts]

39:47.040 --> 39:49.040
[ominous music playing]

39:52.080 --> 39:54.080
[theme music playing]

40:03.760 --> 40:05.040
Bye bye, Nanno.

40:07.320 --> 40:10.880
What will happen to the world now?
It's so exciting.

40:12.840 --> 40:14.840
[theme music continues]

41:12.560 --> 41:14.000
[Nanno] In a world…

41:15.880 --> 41:18.280
where everyone thinks they are free,

41:19.880 --> 41:21.880
and does whatever the hell they want,

41:23.680 --> 41:26.600
am I really necessary anymore?

41:28.960 --> 41:30.960
[dramatic music playing]

41:54.520 --> 41:56.520
[theme music playing]
